 healthy horses and horses with chronicobstructive pulmonary disease, recurrent urticaria, or allergic dermatitis</article-title><source>JAVMA</source><year>2001</year><volume>209</volume><fpage>1115</fpage><lpage>1121</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11700711</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>